(7272221, 1131556, 114969, '<td valign="top">Johanna, you are so talented, I am very impressed of all your recent successes. This entry confirms that fact! It is splendid, fun, full of joy, and perfectly done. Definitely my favorite of the challenge. Thanks a lot!</td>', 'Johanna, you are so talented, I am very impressed of all your recent successes. This entry confirms that fact! It is splendid, fun, full of joy, and perfectly done. Definitely my favorite of the challenge. Thanks a lot!', '2014-10-11 10:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272222, 1131807, 114969, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful sight! The background bokeh is beautiful, and make a perfect set for those mushrooms. The big one, transformed in a little house, is great for inventing many stories that I will tell Emilie, in a few months. Thanks for your work!</td>', 'What a wonderful sight! The background bokeh is beautiful, and make a perfect set for those mushrooms. The big one, transformed in a little house, is great for inventing many stories that I will tell Emilie, in a few months. Thanks for your work!', '2014-10-11 10:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272223, 1131504, 114969, '<td valign="top">Oh, this one really looks like directly from a children storybook! The pink dog is so funny ;-) Then why a little girl, mysteriously surrounded by magical wings, would sit with a pink dog on a branch? So many intriguing questions that I am sure Emilie is going to ask me soon! I better prepare myself for them ;-) Thanks a lot for your inspiring entry!</td>', 'Oh, this one really looks like directly from a children storybook! The pink dog is so funny ;-) Then why a little girl, mysteriously surrounded by magical wings, would sit with a pink dog on a branch? So many intriguing questions that I am sure Emilie is going to ask me soon! I better prepare myself for them ;-) Thanks a lot for your inspiring entry!', '2014-10-11 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272224, 1131560, 114969, '<td valign="top">Emilie is surely going to love all these new friends! Moreover, their world is so cheerful and colorful, I am sure she will ask to visit them soon enough ;-) Thank you for your work, much appreciated :-)</td>', 'Emilie is surely going to love all these new friends! Moreover, their world is so cheerful and colorful, I am sure she will ask to visit them soon enough ;-) Thank you for your work, much appreciated :-)', '2014-10-11 10:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272611, 1131783, 114969, '<td valign="top">Oh, a new friend for Emilie, when the weather is too bad for playing outside... thank you! I love the melancholic mood, very nice lighting and pose for the toy.</td>', 'Oh, a new friend for Emilie, when the weather is too bad for playing outside... thank you! I love the melancholic mood, very nice lighting and pose for the toy.', '2014-10-12 06:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272659, 1131675, 114969, '<td valign="top">Who knows, maybe Emilie will become a painter one day! Thank you so much Margaret for sharing with us your eye for exceptional sights. Your creation is going to be a great way to introduce her to the beauty of our world.</td>', 'Who knows, maybe Emilie will become a painter one day! Thank you so much Margaret for sharing with us your eye for exceptional sights. Your creation is going to be a great way to introduce her to the beauty of our world.', '2014-10-12 10:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272662, 1131808, 114969, '<td valign="top">What a cute new friend for Emilie! I am confident she is actually going to smile and wave soon enough. Great warm colors, and full of happiness, thanks a lot :)</td>', 'What a cute new friend for Emilie! I am confident she is actually going to smile and wave soon enough. Great warm colors, and full of happiness, thanks a lot :)', '2014-10-12 10:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272664, 1131699, 114969, '<td valign="top">Oh, a bunch of new friends for Emilie! And they are even named in French. I especially love the giraffe and her long neck going out of the frame and coming back, so funny :) Thank you!</td>', 'Oh, a bunch of new friends for Emilie! And they are even named in French. I especially love the giraffe and her long neck going out of the frame and coming back, so funny :) Thank you!', '2014-10-12 10:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272666, 1131720, 114969, '<td valign="top">Looks like you also have a very decent collection of plush animals :) I am pretty sure this is going to inspire Emilie a lot, and will force me to visit the toy store regularly... which I will enjoy, as the big kid I still am. Thanks a lot!</td>', 'Looks like you also have a very decent collection of plush animals :) I am pretty sure this is going to inspire Emilie a lot, and will force me to visit the toy store regularly... which I will enjoy, as the big kid I still am. Thanks a lot!', '2014-10-12 10:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272667, 1131755, 114969, '<td valign="top">Haha, talk about a creative entry! What an unbridled imagination. I love it! Sure, Emilie is going to ask some questions, but I am going to have to much gun inventing stories involving the ghost goat, the bag head voter, or the giant cookies! Thank you so much!</td>', 'Haha, talk about a creative entry! What an unbridled imagination. I love it! Sure, Emilie is going to ask some questions, but I am going to have to much gun inventing stories involving the ghost goat, the bag head voter, or the giant cookies! Thank you so much!', '2014-10-12 10:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272669, 1131748, 114969, '<td valign="top">I remember that construction toys were, by far, my favorite when I was a kid. Your entry reminded me that I have now a fantastic excuse to buy new ones and have great fun with my daughter! Hurray! I also love your choice of nice colors, and of course, architecture :) Thank you!</td>', 'I remember that construction toys were, by far, my favorite when I was a kid. Your entry reminded me that I have now a fantastic excuse to buy new ones and have great fun with my daughter! Hurray! I also love your choice of nice colors, and of course, architecture :) Thank you!', '2014-10-12 10:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272681, 1131808, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great use of simple shapes and figures that a child would love, but it feels bottom heavy.  Cropped down or the tiger and text raised would be better.</td>', 'Great use of simple shapes and figures that a child would love, but it feels bottom heavy.  Cropped down or the tiger and text raised would be better.', '2014-10-12 11:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
