(7272789, 1131725, 114969, '<td valign="top">This challenge would have not been complete without our dogs and cats friends! Emilie is already surrounded by them, and I am sure she is going to love that hilarious photographed one :) Thanks a lot for your very funny entry!</td>', 'This challenge would have not been complete without our dogs and cats friends! Emilie is already surrounded by them, and I am sure she is going to love that hilarious photographed one :) Thanks a lot for your very funny entry!', '2014-10-12 15:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272790, 1131044, 114969, '<td valign="top">I agree, eating healthily is a good base to elegance. I have no idea whether Emilie is going to be a dancer or not, but I am definitely use your metaphorical entry to tell her the importance of food... and also to tell her stories about the wonderful world of vegetable dancers! :) Thank you very much for your creation.</td>', 'I agree, eating healthily is a good base to elegance. I have no idea whether Emilie is going to be a dancer or not, but I am definitely use your metaphorical entry to tell her the importance of food... and also to tell her stories about the wonderful world of vegetable dancers! :) Thank you very much for your creation.', '2014-10-12 15:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272791, 1131806, 114969, '<td valign="top">You are so right, life can be difficult at times. Your photo is going to be very useful to explain Emilie that fact, when the time comes. I am in awe at your skills: catching this owl and spotting that lizard must have been quite difficult, not mentioning the very convincing compositing. Thank you so much!</td>', 'You are so right, life can be difficult at times. Your photo is going to be very useful to explain Emilie that fact, when the time comes. I am in awe at your skills: catching this owl and spotting that lizard must have been quite difficult, not mentioning the very convincing compositing. Thank you so much!', '2014-10-12 16:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272796, 1131706, 114969, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful creation. Emilie is going to love it. Grass and leaves are often complicated to process, because they tend to add many distractive shapes to the picture: here, your creative blur worked like a charm, very clever! Thanks a lot for your entry!</td>', 'What a wonderful creation. Emilie is going to love it. Grass and leaves are often complicated to process, because they tend to add many distractive shapes to the picture: here, your creative blur worked like a charm, very clever! Thanks a lot for your entry!', '2014-10-12 16:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272797, 1131712, 114969, '<td valign="top">Haha, this one is probably better in my room than in Emilie''s one, give my recent encounter ;-) Talk about a visual obsession... Kidding aside, I love the very efficient composition, and the moose is so funny to look at! Thank you so much.</td>', 'Haha, this one is probably better in my room than in Emilie''s one, give my recent encounter ;-) Talk about a visual obsession... Kidding aside, I love the very efficient composition, and the moose is so funny to look at! Thank you so much.', '2014-10-12 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272800, 1131790, 114969, '<td valign="top">Poetic, beautiful, and perfect for introducing Emilie to many stories I am sure she is going to love. Thanks a lot !</td>', 'Poetic, beautiful, and perfect for introducing Emilie to many stories I am sure she is going to love. Thanks a lot !', '2014-10-12 16:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272801, 1131538, 114969, '<td valign="top">You are right, a few minutes after her birth this is how I was feeling. That body was so small, seemed so fragile! Yet, I am sure she is going to grow up a become a strong woman soon enough: your picture will help us all remember where she did come from. Thanks a lot!</td>', 'You are right, a few minutes after her birth this is how I was feeling. That body was so small, seemed so fragile! Yet, I am sure she is going to grow up a become a strong woman soon enough: your picture will help us all remember where she did come from. Thanks a lot!', '2014-10-12 16:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272803, 1131514, 114969, '<td valign="top">Haha, we''ll see that in time ;-) But I must say that the imagination of a child is often very hard to equal, so you are quite right, introducing her to those tools could be interesting. We''ll see what she thinks about it in a few years. Meanwhile, thanks a lot for this funny entry, my wife and I got a good laugh, and our daughter will live it too I''m sure!</td>', 'Haha, we''ll see that in time ;-) But I must say that the imagination of a child is often very hard to equal, so you are quite right, introducing her to those tools could be interesting. We''ll see what she thinks about it in a few years. Meanwhile, thanks a lot for this funny entry, my wife and I got a good laugh, and our daughter will live it too I''m sure!', '2014-10-12 16:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272806, 1131815, 114969, '<td valign="top">Definitely! Emilie''s mother is fond of the books and movies: maybe we will visit one of these theme parks soon! In any case, thanks a lot for your entry. Little girls often love mysterious castles (or schools, as long as they are mysterious ;-)) and it will be a great way to introduce her to those wonderful stories, and others too!</td>', 'Definitely! Emilie''s mother is fond of the books and movies: maybe we will visit one of these theme parks soon! In any case, thanks a lot for your entry. Little girls often love mysterious castles (or schools, as long as they are mysterious ;-)) and it will be a great way to introduce her to those wonderful stories, and others too!', '2014-10-12 16:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272808, 1131706, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is what I see in my nightmares :)</td>', 'This is what I see in my nightmares :)', '2014-10-12 16:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272809, 1131805, 114969, '<td valign="top">Well I hope the wolf won''t eat her! Thanks a lot for your great entry, I do hope the dog still loves you even after posing for that one ;-) Emilie already loves animals and keep looking at the cats when one wanders around, so I am sure she is going to love your photo. Thanks again!</td>', 'Well I hope the wolf won''t eat her! Thanks a lot for your great entry, I do hope the dog still loves you even after posing for that one ;-) Emilie already loves animals and keep looking at the cats when one wanders around, so I am sure she is going to love your photo. Thanks again!', '2014-10-12 16:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272810, 1131811, 114969, '<td valign="top">Day dreaming is one of my favorite occupation, maybe it is going to be one of hers too? Time will tell... in any case, thanks a lot for your entry. Any imaginative spirit could easily get lost in those whimsical woods, and I am sure many stories will start there!</td>', 'Day dreaming is one of my favorite occupation, maybe it is going to be one of hers too? Time will tell... in any case, thanks a lot for your entry. Any imaginative spirit could easily get lost in those whimsical woods, and I am sure many stories will start there!', '2014-10-12 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272812, 1131813, 114969, '<td valign="top">Great news, it looks like Emilie already got a friend, and a gentleman with that! Thanks a lot for your entry, very kind of you :)</td>', 'Great news, it looks like Emilie already got a friend, and a gentleman with that! Thanks a lot for your entry, very kind of you :)', '2014-10-12 16:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272814, 1131817, 114969, '<td valign="top">Hurray for imagination! I recognize Magritte (although this could be Hitchcock too, in his own mysterious way), Duchamp, Warhol... all in one picture. So many prestigious friends and examples. Thank you!</td>', 'Hurray for imagination! I recognize Magritte (although this could be Hitchcock too, in his own mysterious way), Duchamp, Warhol... all in one picture. So many prestigious friends and examples. Thank you!', '2014-10-12 16:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272816, 1131810, 114969, '<td valign="top">Oh yeeees. Lego. I am so going to buy trucks of Legos. My favorite game ever, and now I have a great excuse to play it again ;-) Moreover, who can resist mermaids'' songs! Thank you so much for your wonderful entry :)</td>', 'Oh yeeees. Lego. I am so going to buy trucks of Legos. My favorite game ever, and now I have a great excuse to play it again ;-) Moreover, who can resist mermaids'' songs! Thank you so much for your wonderful entry :)', '2014-10-12 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272818, 1131727, 114969, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to play the saxophone. Maybe Emilie will learn it one day, which would give me an excuse to try to? Meanwhile, I am certain that she is going to love the company of the musician ducky :) Thank you so much!</td>', 'I would have loved to play the saxophone. Maybe Emilie will learn it one day, which would give me an excuse to try to? Meanwhile, I am certain that she is going to love the company of the musician ducky :) Thank you so much!', '2014-10-12 16:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
