(7272820, 1131064, 114969, '<td valign="top">Apparently, babies need a few weeks before their vision settle. Maybe this is how she perceives the world for now (I mean, directly)? In any case, your entry is going to be a great reminder that things are not only what can be seen, but probably way more what cannot be. Photographing this is quite a challenge: I appreciated it. Thank you!</td>', 'Apparently, babies need a few weeks before their vision settle. Maybe this is how she perceives the world for now (I mean, directly)? In any case, your entry is going to be a great reminder that things are not only what can be seen, but probably way more what cannot be. Photographing this is quite a challenge: I appreciated it. Thank you!', '2014-10-12 16:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
