(7272830, 1131514, 77196, '<td valign="top">Oh, Yes! The creative energy of Cristophe being discovered and explored by the next generation. Maybe not for a couple of years yet, but still...</td>', 'Oh, Yes! The creative energy of Cristophe being discovered and explored by the next generation. Maybe not for a couple of years yet, but still...', '2014-10-12 17:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272832, 1131517, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Any bets on whether she''s scared off milk for life? Interesting nose...</td>', 'Nice image. Any bets on whether she''s scared off milk for life? Interesting nose...', '2014-10-12 17:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272834, 1131727, 77196, '<td valign="top">Thus begins the poor child''s terror of rubber duckies. I like the darker look and feel of this. Perhaps a bit too grainy, but it still works.</td>', 'Thus begins the poor child''s terror of rubber duckies. I like the darker look and feel of this. Perhaps a bit too grainy, but it still works.', '2014-10-12 17:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272835, 1131807, 77196, '<td valign="top">Subtle. Maybe a bit too cartoonish on the window, but very nice lighting, and definitely an imagination stretcher...</td>', 'Subtle. Maybe a bit too cartoonish on the window, but very nice lighting, and definitely an imagination stretcher...', '2014-10-12 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272839, 1131044, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept! Not sure I''m liking the black line around the purple flower head or the bell hankies. I''m also wishing the white was more like a mirror than just plain white.</td>', 'Great concept! Not sure I''m liking the black line around the purple flower head or the bell hankies. I''m also wishing the white was more like a mirror than just plain white.', '2014-10-12 17:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272842, 1131755, 77196, '<td valign="top">The red evil eye in the goat! Wow - a bit on the surreal side. The cookies look yummy, though - even tho they sort-of look like they''re floating. Extra credit for creativity here, though.</td>', 'The red evil eye in the goat! Wow - a bit on the surreal side. The cookies look yummy, though - even tho they sort-of look like they''re floating. Extra credit for creativity here, though.', '2014-10-12 17:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272844, 1131806, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great image and message. Not sure it wouldn''t be scary for a little one, but would definitely grow on you as you got older. Very nice lighting against the dark mood.</td>', 'Great image and message. Not sure it wouldn''t be scary for a little one, but would definitely grow on you as you got older. Very nice lighting against the dark mood.', '2014-10-12 17:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272845, 1131810, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. Maybe a tad much background in comparison to the main subject.</td>', 'Cute. Maybe a tad much background in comparison to the main subject.', '2014-10-12 17:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272846, 1131712, 77196, '<td valign="top">I think a little one would really like this image (or be terrified of it). I like the sense of motion and pattern it has.</td>', 'I think a little one would really like this image (or be terrified of it). I like the sense of motion and pattern it has.', '2014-10-12 17:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272847, 1131783, 77196, '<td valign="top">Awww. Such a cute bear, and a great idea. Very nice contrast and lighting.</td>', 'Awww. Such a cute bear, and a great idea. Very nice contrast and lighting.', '2014-10-12 17:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272850, 1131720, 77196, '<td valign="top">Don''t give Emelie any ideas - not sure Christophe and wife have enough room for such an extensive collection. Stuffed animals usually get pasted badly on dpc. Hope yours does well.</td>', 'Don''t give Emelie any ideas - not sure Christophe and wife have enough room for such an extensive collection. Stuffed animals usually get pasted badly on dpc. Hope yours does well.', '2014-10-12 17:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272851, 1131790, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very creative and nicely captured. This looks like it would be very hard to do.</td>', 'Very creative and nicely captured. This looks like it would be very hard to do.', '2014-10-12 17:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272853, 1131538, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of an ordinary object to express an imaginative feel.</td>', 'Interesting use of an ordinary object to express an imaginative feel.', '2014-10-12 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272855, 1131719, 77196, '<td valign="top">An image worthy of her dad - fairy tale, science fiction, mother earth, mystery, puzzling, provoking. Only nit is that the horizon doesn''t look level.</td>', 'An image worthy of her dad - fairy tale, science fiction, mother earth, mystery, puzzling, provoking. Only nit is that the horizon doesn''t look level.', '2014-10-12 17:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272857, 1131709, 77196, '<td valign="top">Quite cute. Like the use of blue for the L but red for the other letters. Not sure what the furry creature is, but it is cute.</td>', 'Quite cute. Like the use of blue for the L but red for the other letters. Not sure what the furry creature is, but it is cute.', '2014-10-12 17:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272858, 1131817, 77196, '<td valign="top">The title says it all. Interesting superimposition, colors, and semi-recognizable objects.</td>', 'The title says it all. Interesting superimposition, colors, and semi-recognizable objects.', '2014-10-12 17:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272859, 1131815, 77196, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of fisheye, but here its use nicely conveys that there is more here than meets the eye, or one would expect. Nice monochrome.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of fisheye, but here its use nicely conveys that there is more here than meets the eye, or one would expect. Nice monochrome.', '2014-10-12 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272860, 1131725, 77196, '<td valign="top">Purrfectly adorable. Great idea. Nicely executed.</td>', 'Purrfectly adorable. Great idea. Nicely executed.', '2014-10-12 17:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272861, 1131706, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the tonal palate changes from the foreground to the background, making the result a bit jarring.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the tonal palate changes from the foreground to the background, making the result a bit jarring.', '2014-10-12 17:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272862, 1131699, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept and nicely done.</td>', 'Great concept and nicely done.', '2014-10-12 17:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272863, 1131556, 77196, '<td valign="top">I really like the splashes around the duck. Great message, and compelling image.</td>', 'I really like the splashes around the duck. Great message, and compelling image.', '2014-10-12 17:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272864, 1131504, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable! Love the blue to purple palette and the mood it conveys.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable! Love the blue to purple palette and the mood it conveys.', '2014-10-12 17:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272865, 1131805, 77196, '<td valign="top">The font is difficult to read, and I''m not sure I like the washed out look. But anyone that can get a dog to pose with granny glasses and a bonnet (even thru editing)... A bit too reminiscent of the Big Bad Wolf in Granny''s bed in the Little Red Riding Hood story... Still, nicely executed.</td>', 'The font is difficult to read, and I''m not sure I like the washed out look. But anyone that can get a dog to pose with granny glasses and a bonnet (even thru editing)... A bit too reminiscent of the Big Bad Wolf in Granny''s bed in the Little Red Riding Hood story... Still, nicely executed.', '2014-10-12 17:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272867, 1131731, 77196, '<td valign="top">Sweet. Like the softened brightness, but without losing any of the sharpness.</td>', 'Sweet. Like the softened brightness, but without losing any of the sharpness.', '2014-10-12 17:28:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7272868, 1131560, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a crew! To me, this comes across a bit flat, regardless of your good efforts to use shadow, etc. to enhance 3D. For me, the beards are a bit too close to inverted hats in shape. Still, I think a child would really like this.</td>', 'What a crew! To me, this comes across a bit flat, regardless of your good efforts to use shadow, etc. to enhance 3D. For me, the beards are a bit too close to inverted hats in shape. Still, I think a child would really like this.', '2014-10-12 17:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272882, 1131817, 11769, '<td valign="top">this will make her think</td>', 'this will make her think', '2014-10-12 19:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272889, 1131794, 114969, '<td valign="top">This challenge would not be complete without the mythical Godzilla! I am so glad to see him there... and I am also glad he is going to defend Emilie''s room against threats, rather than attacking it ;-) Thank you so much for your fun, full of happiness and brilliant entry!</td>', 'This challenge would not be complete without the mythical Godzilla! I am so glad to see him there... and I am also glad he is going to defend Emilie''s room against threats, rather than attacking it ;-) Thank you so much for your fun, full of happiness and brilliant entry!', '2014-10-12 19:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272890, 1131709, 114969, '<td valign="top">This is so cute :) I love the soft colors and peaceful mood, everything Emilie needs to learn reading. It is still a bit soon of course, but be sure I''ll use your photo when the time comes. Thanks a lot!</td>', 'This is so cute :) I love the soft colors and peaceful mood, everything Emilie needs to learn reading. It is still a bit soon of course, but be sure I''ll use your photo when the time comes. Thanks a lot!', '2014-10-12 19:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272891, 1131517, 114969, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the most simpler things are the most efficient: your photo is a perfect example! So much fun in here :) I love the saturated and joyful colors, and the processing suits that mood perfectly. I''m sure Emilie is going to be fond of her new big friend. Thank you!</td>', 'Sometimes the most simpler things are the most efficient: your photo is a perfect example! So much fun in here :) I love the saturated and joyful colors, and the processing suits that mood perfectly. I''m sure Emilie is going to be fond of her new big friend. Thank you!', '2014-10-12 19:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272893, 1131731, 150277, '<td valign="top">Aww, very sweet.  Photographically I love the light and the creativity.</td>', 'Aww, very sweet.  Photographically I love the light and the creativity.', '2014-10-12 20:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272894, 1131805, 150277, '<td valign="top">Cute.  It looks maybe a little too muted on my screen, kind of hard for me to read.</td>', 'Cute.  It looks maybe a little too muted on my screen, kind of hard for me to read.', '2014-10-12 20:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
